>兆元，創今年以來單月新高，但有大聯大、聯電、兆豐金等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">82</span>家<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月合併營收創新高，及台塑化、台化、福懋、台灣高鐵等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">127</span>家創新低，營運呈現兩極化。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">根據統計，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月合併營收<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.69</span>兆元，月增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">0.18</span>％，年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2.38</span>％；累計前四月合併營收<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">10.11</span>兆元，年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5.66</span>％。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">今年<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>月初新冠肺炎疫情爆發以來打亂了企業的腳步，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">1</span>月及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">2</span>月中斷的貨源遞延至<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>月及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月拉貨，並為了確保供應鏈貨源充足，強化了拉貨力道，推升上市櫃公司營收成長，其中電子業及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">IC</span>通路商最明顯，如大聯大及豐藝等。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">至於因新冠肺炎受到衝擊的觀光、運輸、餐飲、航空、紡織、娛樂業等持續低迷，如有台灣高鐵、晶華、台南、好樂迪、國賓、漢來美食等<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月合併營收創新低。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">除了新冠肺炎來攪局外，國際油價劇烈重挫也影響了塑化業、油電燃氣、橡膠產業<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月營收創新低，如台塑化、台化、福懋、全國、華豐、南港等。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">第一金投顧董事長陳奕光表示，新冠肺炎及油價幾乎貫穿了今年上半年的經濟活動，受惠及受害的上市櫃公司營運呈現相當兩極化，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月合併營收共計有<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">127</span>家創新低，比<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">3</span>月的<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">63</span>家更擴大，疫情衝擊下民眾緊縮消費支出。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">統一投顧董事長黎方國表示，美國就業市場雖然面臨史上最嚴峻的失業，但隨著新冠肺炎疫情趨於緩和，經濟活動漸漸恢復，初領失業救濟金人數已連續五周下滑，且美國解除封鎖的州數正逐漸增加，未來經濟即將重啟並回穩。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">黎方國強調，疫情僅是今年經濟波動的一個插曲，為了迎接下半年電子業消費旺季及<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">5G</span>新商機，企業並未對疫情而有所遲疑，並確保供應鏈貨源充足，而出現提前拉貨的情況，使得今年台股上市櫃公司的公司的電子業<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月營收表現不俗，特別是半導體產業。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">根據資料統計，<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">4</span>月半導體產業營收年增<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">20.6</span>％，電子通路產業年增達<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">15.9</span>％。衰退幅度最大的前三大類為觀光類年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">57.5</span>％、油電燃氣類年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">54.9</span>％、紡織纖維類呈現年減<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">34.2</span>％。</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14pt; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 微軟正黑體, sans-serif;\\\">資料來源：<span lang=\\\"EN-US\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box;\\\">https://ctee.com.tw/news/stock/266690.html</span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p initial=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 30px; display: block; margin-block-start: 0.1em; margin-block-end: 0.1em; margin-inline-start: 0px; margin-inline-end: 0px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: 微軟正黑體, \\\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n","keyword":"","news_order_id":"0","create_date":"2020-05-12","clk_count":"164"}}